WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:16.453
"I'm going to clean my closet," said Aunt Judy.

2
00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:19.954
"I have lots of old clothes.

3
00:00:19.955 --> 00:00:24.478
I need room for my new clothes."

4
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:27.699
"I will help," said Emmy.

5
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:34.699
"I like old clothes!"

6
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:41.361
"People wore funny clothes long ago," said Harry.

7
00:00:41.362 --> 00:00:46.169
"I like funny things!" said Oliver.

8
00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:51.495
Aunt Judy laughed.

9
00:00:51.496 --> 00:00:55.937
"You can keep anything you like."

10
00:00:55.938 --> 00:00:59.480
"Thanks, Aunt Judy," said Emmy.

11
00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:03.501
"But nobody wears old clothes."

12
00:01:03.502 --> 00:01:11.192
"Nobody wears funny clothes either," said Harry.

13
00:01:11.193 --> 00:01:15.627
Aunt Judy opened her closet.

14
00:01:15.628 --> 00:01:18.797
She took out a green scarf.

15
00:01:18.798 --> 00:01:23.274
The scarf sparkled.

16
00:01:23.275 --> 00:01:26.298
"Cool!" said Emmy.

17
00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:30.333
Aunt Judy smiled.

18
00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:35.340
Emmy put on the scarf.

19
00:01:35.341 --> 00:01:39.266
Aunt Judy took out a hat.

20
00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.885
"Cool!" said Harry.

21
00:01:42.886 --> 00:01:46.124
"It looks like a spy's hat!"

22
00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:50.035
Harry put on the hat.

23
00:01:50.036 --> 00:01:55.607
Aunt Judy took out a white shirt.

24
00:01:55.608 --> 00:02:01.703
"I need a white shirt to play doctor!" said Oliver.

25
00:02:01.704 --> 00:02:04.579
Aunt Judy took out a sweater.

26
00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.345
The sweater had a lion on the front.

27
00:02:08.346 --> 00:02:14.814
"I love it!" said Emmy.

28
00:02:14.815 --> 00:02:19.790
Aunt Judy took out a vest.

29
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:25.169
"I need a vest for my school play!" said Harry.

30
00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.973
Aunt Judy smiled.

31
00:02:28.974 --> 00:02:33.954
"Now I have room for new clothes," she said.

32
00:02:33.955 --> 00:02:41.031
"Now we need to clean our closets!" said Emmy.
